    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_select_01",
      "hash64": "8BC7207E364EB1D7",
      "text": "Un petit creux, madame ?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_select_02",
      "hash64": "8BC7217E364EB38A",
      "text": "Une soudaine envie de faire la cuisine ?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_02",
      "hash64": "D2ED3388983CE6C1",
      "text": "Non, non. Ce n’est pas la raison de ma venue ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_03",
      "hash64": "D2ED3288983CE50E",
      "text": "C’est juste que tout à l’heure, quand je suis\\npassée dans le hall d’entrée...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_04",
      "hash64": "D2ED3588983CEA27",
      "text": "... j’ai à nouveau senti sur moi ce regard intense\\ndont je te parlais la dernière fois ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_05",
      "hash64": "D2ED3488983CE874",
      "text": "Vu que j’étais proche de la cafétéria,\\nje me suis dépêchée de m’y rendre.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_06",
      "hash64": "D2ED3788983CED8D",
      "text": "La cafétéria n’ayant qu’une seule entrée, je me\\nsuis dit que si quelqu’un me suivait, je pourrais\\r\\nimmédiatement voir de qui il s’agit.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_07",
      "hash64": "D2ED3688983CEBDA",
      "text": "Oh ! Voilà quelqu’un ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_woman_01",
      "hash64": "F42347F9AB47717F",
      "text": "Hum, c’est bizarre... J’étais pourtant sûre\\nde l’avoir vue entrer ici...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_woman_02",
      "hash64": "F42348F9AB477332",
      "text": "On dirait que ma question va encore devoir\\nattendre...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_08",
      "hash64": "D2ED2988983CD5C3",
      "text": "Cette fille... Maintenant que j’y pense, je l’ai\\ndéjà aperçue à plusieurs reprises...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_09",
      "hash64": "D2ED2888983CD410",
      "text": "On dirait bien que c’est une élève de l’école,\\nmais son attitude me pousse à penser que\\r\\nsa question ne concerne pas mes cours...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_10",
      "hash64": "D2E9AB889839C9D2",
      "text": "La prochaine fois que je la verrai, j’irai lui parler ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_11",
      "hash64": "D2E9AC889839CB85",
      "text": "Merci d’être là, en tout cas. C’était rassurant\\nde t’avoir à mes côtés.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kizuna_math_c_system_01",
      "hash64": "14795A4C3BC6A7F4",
      "text": "Vous avez gagné la confiance de madame Thaïm !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
